  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenccNetLib v1.6.1\n\n            - Added direct Hong Kong phrase conversions: t2hkp and hk2tp.\n            - Added CJK Compatibility Ideograph normalization with NormalizeCompat().\n            - Added optional Unicode IDS preservation during conversion.\n            - Hardened Office/EPUB package rebuilding with validation and atomic output writes.\n            - Improved conversion reliability with stronger input validation and exception handling.\n            - Updated dictionary data, tests, and documentation.\n\n            Breaking: custom dictionary bundles must include jps_characters_rev; regenerate custom JSON/CBOR/Zstd bundles for v1.6.x.",
